@identityUrl = http://localhost:5106
@diningUrl = http://localhost:5102
@restaurantId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@tableId = c270b467-98cc-47b2-b241-e45979659bf6
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Obtener JWT de responsable
# @name login
POST {{identityUrl}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager",
  "password": "Manager-2026!"
}

### Listar mesas del local asignado
GET {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Consultar política Dining
GET {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/policy
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Configurar políticas operativas del local
PUT {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/policy
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qrRequiresImmediatePayment": true,
  "requireTrustedNetworkForQr": false,
  "takeawayRequiresPrepayment": true,
  "qrAllowedNetworks": []
}

### Exigir presencia en la red del local (ejemplo para F5 en localhost)
PUT {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/policy
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qrRequiresImmediatePayment": true,
  "requireTrustedNetworkForQr": true,
  "takeawayRequiresPrepayment": true,
  "qrAllowedNetworks": [
    "127.0.0.1/32",
    "::1/128"
  ]
}

### Rotar el QR de la mesa; invalida inmediatamente el codigo anterior
# @name rotateQr
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/tables/{{tableId}}/qr/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Consultar la carta por QR: no abre ni ocupa una sesion
GET {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/qr/{{rotateQr.response.body.$.qrCode}}

### Confirmar el primer pedido: abre una sesion CustomerQr o recupera la propia
# @name openQrSession
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/qr/{{rotateQr.response.body.$.qrCode}}/sessions?guestCount=2

### Simular un cliente fuera del local; debe responder HTTP 403
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/qr/{{rotateQr.response.body.$.qrCode}}/sessions?guestCount=2
X-Forwarded-For: 203.0.113.50

### Crear una zona; el nombre y las ubicaciones los configura el usuario
# @name createZone
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salón principal",
  "sortOrder": 0
}
### Crear una mesa fisica neutral; su uso posterior puede ser QR, comandero o TPV
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "MESA-03",
  "label": "Mesa 03",
  "zoneId": "{{createZone.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### Crear otra ubicacion con nombre libre y QR propio
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/restaurants/{{restaurantId}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "BARRA-06",
  "label": "Puesto de barra 06",
  "zoneId": "{{createZone.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### Ocupa la mesa indicada; respondera 409 si ya tiene una sesion abierta
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/tables/{{tableId}}/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "WaiterMobile"
}

### Consultar la sesion activa de una mesa
GET {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/tables/{{tableId}}/active-session
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Validacion interna usada por Orders; sustituya sessionId
GET {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/sessions/{{sessionId}}/validate?restaurantId={{restaurantId}}&tableId={{tableId}}

### Cuenta completa de la sesion
GET {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/sessions/{{sessionId}}/bill
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Liberar manualmente una mesa con todos sus pedidos pagados
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/sessions/{{sessionId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Cancelar una sesion vacia abierta por error; sustituya sessionId
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/sessions/{{sessionId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Mesa abierta por error durante una prueba"
}

### Cobra todas las comandas entregadas y libera la mesa
POST {{diningUrl}}/api/dining/sessions/{{sessionId}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "method": "Card",
  "externalReference": "HTTP-CHECKOUT-01"
}

